1. Steps to Create the Microservice
Step 1: Define the Requirements
The microservice should:

Accept user inputs (e.g., prompts, files).

Use OpenAI to process prompts.

Use RAG (Retrieval-Augmented Generation) to search through documents.

For specific prompts (e.g., "create issue"), call GitLab API to:

Upload attachments using /uploads.

Create an issue using /issues.

